 *
 * Implements FSEntry_Open/Close/Args/File/Func/GetBytes/PutBytes; carries the always-on diagnostic infrastructure
 * (FSE_ENTER / FSE_PATH / FSE_OK ring buffer, FSE_FAIL signature dedupe) that captures recent FSEntry traffic for
 * a dump for diagnosis on the first occurrence of each unique (handler, reason, errnum) failure.
 */
